claim.claim-text:
a developing roller (12) that is rotatable about a first axis (A1) extending in an axial direction;
a casing (11) including
a developing chamber (11A) positioned inside the casing (11) and that is capable of accommodating toner to be supplied to the developing roller (12), and
a toner accommodation chamber (11B) positioned inside the casing (11) and that is capable of accommodating toner to be supplied to the developing chamber (11A);

a coupling (22) that is rotatable both in a first direction and in a second direction opposite to the first direction about a second axis (A2) extending in the axial direction and includes a coupling gear (22B);
an auger (16) or an agitator that is capable of supplying the toner in the toner accommodation chamber (11B) to the developing chamber (11A) and is rotatable about an auger axis (16X) extending in the axial direction;
a transporting gear (26) that is rotatable together with the auger (16) or the agitator; and
a moving gear (33) that is in mesh with the coupling gear (22B) and is rotatable both in the first direction and the second direction about a third axis (A3) extending in the axial direction, the moving gear (33) being movable while being in mesh with the coupling gear (22B) between a first position where the moving gear (33) is in mesh with the transporting gear (26) and a second position where the moving gear (33) is out of mesh with the transporting gear (26), the moving gear (33) moving to the first position when the coupling gear (22B) rotates in the first direction and to the second position when the coupling gear (22B) rotates in the second direction.

a photosensitive drum (5B),
wherein the toner accommodation chamber (11B) is attachable to and detachable from the developing device (110);
optionally wherein the developing device includes a drum cartridge.

a supply roller (13) that supplies toner to the developing roller (12); and
a supply roller gear (24) positioned at an end portion of the supply roller (13) and that rotates together with the supply roller (13), the supply roller gear (24) being in mesh with the second idle gear (35);
optionally wherein:
